    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight view into a specific layer with inheritance from base. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classstar_1_1LayerView" kindref="compound">LayerView</ref> provides the same API as <ref refid="classstar_1_1StarDataset" kindref="compound">StarDataset</ref> but operates on a specific layer. Keys not found in the layer automatically fall back to the base layer.</para>
<para>Example: auto ds = <ref refid="classstar_1_1StarDataset_1a7da82ee4803e6302ad903e12e3c4c0c7" kindref="member">StarDataset::open</ref>(&quot;file.stards&quot;); auto layer1 = ds-&gt;create_layer(&quot;band_0&quot;); layer1-&gt;meta.put(&quot;wavelength&quot;, <ref refid="classstar_1_1NDArray" kindref="compound">NDArray&lt;double&gt;</ref>({}, 450.5)); // Layer-specific auto inst = layer1-&gt;meta.get(&quot;instrument&quot;); // Falls back to base </para>
    </detaileddescription>
